    "testimonial_slider_tAedcK": {
      "type": "testimonial-slider",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_slide_NMTtyL": {
          "type": "testimonial_slide",
          "settings": {
            "banner": "shopify://shop_images/Mask_group_109d16f1-0c58-4899-b2b8-68a6a13b2bc2.webp",
            "product": "pure-himalayan-shilajit-resin",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Review__Resin.webp",
            "rating_count": 5,
            "review_text": "Authentic and Premium Shilajit Resin!\nI’ve got to say, this Shilajit resin feels like the real deal ⚫. The texture is thick, tarry, and pitch black—just as authentic Shilajit should be. The scent and taste are spot on, earthy yet mild, and it mixes easily into my protein shake without being overpowering. The packaging is elegant and practical, and I really appreciate the inclusion of the small silver dosing spoon. It’s sticky and a bit tricky to handle, but that’s the nature of genuine, high-quality resin. Overall, it’s a premium product that feels potent and well-crafted. I’m very happy with it and would definitely recommend it.",
            "person_name": "Kasmo"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_slide_t3RR7k": {
          "type": "testimonial_slide",
          "settings": {
            "banner": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_40045.webp",
            "product": "pure-shilajit-liquid-drops",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Review__Liquid.webp",
            "rating_count": 5,
            "review_text": "Everything is great about this package except the taste. Let's just say it tastes pretty bad for me compared to other energy stimulants I tried in the past. Fortunately, one only has to use three drops in the morning and three in the afternoon to help with energy. Preferably this is mixed with some liquid of preference. The package is very professional and ensures that the bottle arrives safe. I like adding healthy minerals, in this case minerals from Nepal, to my diet and this liquid makes a positive difference so far. I was going to subtract a star for the taste but that would not be fair considering that the description clearly states that the flavor is \" extremely bitter\" and \"earthly\". It really made me think of my grandma's animal farm in the mountains.",
            "person_name": "Ardeal"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_slide_KVeQrz": {
          "type": "testimonial_slide",
          "settings": {
            "banner": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_40046.webp",
            "product": "pure-shilajit-liquid-drops",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Review__Resin.webp",
            "rating_count": 5,
            "review_text": "I ordered this for a male friend who is soon trying to conceive. I first heard about Shilajit on a podcast about reproductive health, where it was recommended for men. The resin has a very strong bitter taste. It’s hard to mask even when mixed with food. The texture is thick and sticky. It comes with a spoon that's inside the box at the top. The small container contains 60 servings, so a little goes a long way. It dissolves slowly in warm liquids, which seems to be the best way to take it. Whether it works or not is something that will take time to notice. Nevertheless, with its reputation as a traditional adaptogen and the high concentration of fulvic acid, it seems worth a try for those exploring natural options. The bitterness might be a dealbreaker for some, but if you’ve exhausted other health choices, this could be a useful addition.",
            "person_name": "VAl"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_slide_AFGiFc": {
          "type": "testimonial_slide",
          "settings": {
            "banner": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_40051.webp",
            "product": "pure-shilajit-liquid-drops",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Review__Liquid.webp",
            "rating_count": 5,
            "review_text": "Nice quality Shilajit.\nThis is a quality Shilajit that is well presented and would make a great gift. I'm not going to justify Shilajit and why you want it, if you are here you should already know. Yes, it tastes like cigarette ashes, and Lagavulin tastes like burnt rubber (but in a good way). This is Shilajit. The packaging is nice, the bottle and dropper are quality. The Shilajit appears black, but if you rub it about you will see it is actually a very very very dark brown. It is not quite as thick as honey, but it is thick. It is high priced but I think they have earned it.",
            "person_name": "Joe"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_slide_n7dmfY": {
          "type": "testimonial_slide",
          "settings": {
            "banner": "shopify://shop_images/Mask_group_f3c37625-5553-495a-b7a7-fabc4439575f.webp",
            "product": "pure-shilajit-liquid-drops",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Review__Resin.webp",
            "rating_count": 5,
            "review_text": "Pure Strength\nI can usually tell right away if shilajit is the real deal, and this one is. The bitter taste is actually a good sign...it means it's unadulterated and potent. I dissolve a small bit into warm water each morning, and it gives me a steady stream of energy throughout the day. No jitters, no crashes. Just clean, grounded stamina. What I Like The bitterness confirms it's pure and strong Sourced from high altitudes in Nepal, which matters Dissolves well in warm water or milk Comes with a copper spoon and instructions Lasts a long time—tiny amounts go far Concerns Bitter taste may not be for everyone Jar is small, so be careful not to use more than needed This is one of the more authentic forms I’ve tried. If you know what you’re doing with shilajit, this one checks all the boxes.",
            "person_name": "Ramses"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_slide_XfJyBV": {
          "type": "testimonial_slide",
          "settings": {
            "banner": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_40052.webp",
            "product": "pure-shilajit-liquid-drops",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Review__Liquid.webp",
            "rating_count": 5,
            "review_text": "Easy to Use and High Quality Shilajit\nI’ve tried Himalayan Shilajit in many forms, and this is my favorite, it’s so much easier than pure resin, and is more viable and purer than gummies. The taste is what I suspected, very bitter, so I strongly recommend mixing this with teas and coffees, even then, the taste will be very noticeable! This is a 250-day supply and possibly more so if using less than the recommended three drops. I’ve been using two and will eventually work it up three after I'm more acclimated to it. I like that it’s made in Nepal, comes with a certificate of authenticity and it has two ingredients, raw shilajit and spring water.",
            "person_name": "Jesse P"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_slide_tjwEdV": {
          "type": "testimonial_slide",
          "settings": {
            "banner": "shopify://shop_images/Mask_group-1_771792ac-4392-4163-b23f-7c4ab16a5299.webp",
            "product": "pure-shilajit-liquid-drops",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Review__Resin.webp",
            "rating_count": 5,
            "review_text": "Authentic, Powerful Shilajit with Real Results. After seeing all the feedback and trying the Everest Pure Himalayan Shilajit Resin myself, I can understand why it’s so highly rated. The quality and authenticity truly stand out — it’s thick, rich, and earthy, just like real Himalayan Shilajit should be. The packaging is excellent, with a sturdy glass jar and a handy measuring spoon that makes dosing simple. I appreciate that it’s lab tested and sourced from Nepal, known for producing some of the purest, most mineral-rich Shilajit in the world. The 75% fulvic acid content definitely makes it potent — I’ve noticed steady energy, improved focus, and better endurance without any crash. The taste is strong and bitter, which is completely normal for pure Shilajit, but it mixes easily with warm water, tea, or milk. If you can get past that, the benefits are well worth it. Overall, this product deserves its solid 4.2-star reputation — authentic, powerful, and effective for supporting energy, recovery, and mental clarity.",
            "person_name": "Mas"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_slide_9r9aqR": {
          "type": "testimonial_slide",
          "settings": {
            "banner": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_40045_82e4297f-b50f-421d-a30e-9a15f78e372f.webp",
            "product": "pure-shilajit-liquid-drops",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Review__Liquid.webp",
            "rating_count": 5,
            "review_text": "Great Shilajit product & very cost effective! 👍🏻👍🏻. I found this Shilajit does look and smell like the real deal, and it is listed as coming from a GMP (Good Manufacturing Practices) manufacturing site. The packaging is impressive, too. However, it was supposed to contain a Certificate of Analysis, and that was missing from my package. I contacted Everest Shilajit via the email seen on the bottle, and they kindly did get back to me. They provided several documents which shows an analysis of my batch # by Eurofins lab, as well as a copy of their Good Manufacturing Practices system certification. I see to work in the pharmaceutical industry and have seen Eurofins test results in the past, and the documentation Everest Shilajit provided all appear legitimate. I have full confidence in their product after seeing this documentation. Also note it is a very cost effective Shilajit product, considering the liquid dosing is 3 drops per day (mixed in a drink). So this one bottle should last me 250 days! I found it didn’t alter the taste of my green tea or GatorAde in a bad way. It does have a characteristic smell direct from the bottle, which isn’t really pleasant but also isn’t noticeable once mixed in a drink.",
            "person_name": "Trace"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_slide_JnWKxz": {
          "type": "testimonial_slide",
          "settings": {
            "banner": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_40050.webp",
            "product": "pure-shilajit-liquid-drops",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Review__Resin.webp",
            "rating_count": 5,
            "review_text": "Caution and Confidence for Shilajit Users!\nI’ve been researching Shilajit for a long time. On the market, there are products ranging from very cheap to very expensive, some labeled organic or natural. During my research, I noticed that many companies hide their certificates and it’s often unclear how much heavy metals are in their products. I’m not saying this to praise this brand or criticize others, but if you plan to use Shilajit, thorough research is essential. When I chose this product, I carefully checked the certificates, third-party tests, and heavy metal content. The test results indicated that this product is free from heavy metals. The information on the company’s website and my research gave me confidence to use it safely. Yes, the resin is very strong, the taste is intense, and it’s not particularly pleasant. But considering its benefits — energy support, anti-aging, and overall health — I feel it’s worth it. After all, we women put up with a lot for our health and beauty, right? 😊 So, whichever brand you choose, make sure to research thoroughly and pick a reliable Shilajit product. Based on my research, I trust this one and recommend it.",
            "person_name": "Mine"
          }
        }
      },
